title: "Trinity: Ternary Vector Symbolic Architecture Framework"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
version: 0.11.0
date-released: 2026-03-08
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/gHashTag/trinity"
